  description: Saturn is the sixth planet from the Sun and the second-largest planet
    in the Solar System. It is a gas giant best known for its extensive system of
    rings, which contain countless particles of ice, rock, and dust.
  interestingFact: Saturn's rings extend hundreds of thousands of kilometers across,
    but in many places they are surprisingly thin compared with their width.
